      "blocks": {
        "faq_QrEh8D": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About Our Products",
            "question": "What’s the difference between Skin❤️Shield and BambooTek™?",
            "answer": "<p>Skin❤️Shield is our primary diaper product, that is TCF and EWG Verified®. BambooTek™ is an environmentally friendly option that we're phasing out of our lineup. Both offer stellar skin protection and clean, non-toxic construction. <br/><br/>You can find Skin❤️Shield on our site, at <a href=\"https://www.target.com/p/freestyle-hyper-absorbent-ultra-soft-baby-diapers/-/A-94937680?preselect=94800623#lnk=sametab\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.target.com/p/freestyle-hyper-absorbent-ultra-soft-baby-diapers/-/A-94937680?preselect=94800623#lnk=sametab\">Target.com</a>, <a href=\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Freestyle-Diaper-Size-4-48CT/13932710597\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Freestyle-Diaper-Size-4-48CT/13932710597\">Walmart.com</a> and select Walmart stores nationwide (find one <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\" title=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\">here</a>). You can find BambooTek™ on <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Freestyle-Diapers-Absorbent-Non-Toxic-Disposable/dp/B0D672ZNG5?ref_=ast_sto_dp&th=1\" title=\"https://www.amazon.com/Freestyle-Diapers-Absorbent-Non-Toxic-Disposable/dp/B0D672ZNG5?ref_=ast_sto_dp&th=1\">Amazon</a> and at select retailers nationwide (find one <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\" title=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\">here</a>).</p>",
            "question-1": "How do I know what size to buy?",
            "answer-1": "<p>Each Skin❤️Shield size is based on your baby's weight: </p><p></p><ul><li>Newborn - up to 10 lbs</li><li>Size 1 – 6-12 lbs</li><li>Size 2 – 9-18 lbs</li><li>Size 3 – 14-24 lbs</li><li>Size 4 – 22-34 lbs</li><li>Size 5 – 28-40 lbs</li><li>Size 6 – 34-44 lbs. </li></ul><p></p><p>If your baby's weight overlaps two sizes, go with your usual size in other brands, or size up for extra overnight comfort.<br/><br/>Find out what size you need in Skin❤️Shield [here] and BambooTek™ [here].</p>",
            "question-2": "I saw someone online with Newborn diapers, where can I buy them?",
            "answer-2": "<p>Find newborn Skin❤️Shield diapers on our website <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/products/skinshield-diapers\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>, at <a href=\"https://www.target.com/p/freestyle-hyper-absorbent-ultra-soft-baby-diapers/-/A-94937680?preselect=94800621#lnk=sametab\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Target.com,</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Freestyle-Diaper-Size-NB-56CT/13911911502?classType=VARIANT&from=/search\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Walmart.com</span></a>, and in Target and Walmart stores nationwide. Check our <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Store Locator</span></a> to find your nearest location.</p><p><br/>Should you want to purchase more than three packs of NB diapers on our website directly, write us at hello@freestyle.world so we can help.</p>",
            "question-3": "The Freestyle Formula: What ingredients does Freestyle use in its products?",
            "answer-3": "<p>Skin❤️Shield EWG Verified® diapers: the core of this diaper is made with our proprietary SAP Matrix (super absorbent polymers (sodium acrylate, silicon dioxide, polyacrylic acid, water)) and FSC Certified Total Chlorine Free wood pulp (cellulose, hemicellulose). The topsheet, backsheet, leakguard, and films are made with performance-driven nonwoven fabrics (polypropylene, polyethylene terephthalate, polythene, titanium dioxide, nylon and polyester, sodium dodecylbenzenesulfonate). Elastics (polypropylene, segmented polyurethaneurea, titanium dioxide) and adhesives (hydrocarbon resin, styrene-Isoprene-styrene copolymer, mineral oil, petroleum resin, rosin ester) are used to hold it all together - and we mean all.<br/><br/>BambooTek™ diapers: our diaper is made from our proprietary tree-free, Bamboo Tek™ core (100% bamboo pulp and superabsorbent polymer), performance driven non-woven fabrics (polypropylene and polyethylene), water-soluble, toxin-free inks, and some elastic (spandex, polypropylene and polyethylene) to hold it all together.<br/><br/>Ultra Clean 99% Water Wipes: Water (Aqua), Sodium Benzoate, Caprylyl Glycol,\u0003Gluconolactone, Citric Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Decyl \u0003Glucoside, Chamomilla Recutita (Chamomile)\u0003Flower Extract.</p>",
            "question-4": "Are your products clean?",
            "answer-4": "<p>Skin❤️Shield diapers and Ultra Clean 99% Water Wipes are EWG Verified®!</p><p>Skin❤️Shield diapers are non-toxic, Total Chlorine Free, hypoallergenic, and tested free of many chemicals of concern, including things like parabens, phthalates, and heavy metals.<br/><br/>We test our diapers at an independent, third-party lab against leading brands. Read more <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/safety-and-testing\" title=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/safety-and-testing\">here</a>. </p>",
            "question-5": "How are Freestyle diapers different?",
            "answer-5": "<p>We created the most innovative diaper we could because we needed it. And you do too. Freestyle’s Skin❤️Shield diaper features proprietary technology that makes it up to 14x more absorbent than a leading brand at the same price per diaper. It’s super-soft and will keep them dry all night long. So you can sleep all night long.<br/><br/>Find out more <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/products/skinshield-diapers\" title=\"https://freestyle.world/products/skinshield-diapers\">here</a>. </p>",
            "question-6": "Do you offer samples?",
            "answer-6": "<p>Later this year, we’ll be offering samples on our website. Stay tuned and sign up for our emails to be notified!</p>",
            "question-7": "",
            "answer-7": ""
          }
        },
