            "title": "Order Management",
            "question": "Can I set up a Skin❤️Shield diaper subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, on our website <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/products/skinshield-diapers\" title=\"https://freestyle.world/products/skinshield-diapers\">here</a>.</p>",
            "question-1": "",
            "answer-1": "",
            "question-2": "Can I change or cancel an order after I place it?",
            "answer-2": "<p>Please reach out to us at hello@freestyle.world as soon as you can and we'll do our best to catch it in time. </p><p>Once an order moves into processing, <strong>we can't make changes.</strong></p>",
            "question-3": "Do you sell gift cards?",
            "answer-3": "<p>Not at the moment, however we’re working on it!</p>",
