        "faq_Kn76qA": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping",
            "question": "When will I receive my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders typically take <strong>1-2 business days to process and usually arrive in 3-4 business days.</strong> You'll receive tracking info so you can follow your package every step of the way. Orders ship via UPS Ground and may be handed off to a local courier for the final leg of delivery. We currently can't offer any shipping options other than UPS Ground.</p>",
            "question-1": "How much does shipping cost?",
            "answer-1": "<p>Shipping is free for any order with diapers. </p><p>Shipping fees are noted at checkout for orders without diapers. </p>",
            "question-2": "Where do you ship?",
            "answer-2": "<p>We ship throughout the contiguous United States.<strong> We're not able to ship to PO boxes</strong>.  If we don't ship to your area yet, email us at hello@freestyle.world and let us know where we should ship next!</p>",
            "question-3": "My order hasn't arrived, or tracking says delivered but I don't see it, what do I do?",
            "answer-3": "<p>Reach out to us at hello@freestyle.world and we'll look into it. Carriers sometimes mark a package as delivered a little early, so it's worth checking with neighbors first; either way, let us know, and we'll do our best to track it down for you.</p>",
            "question-4": "",
            "answer-4": "",
            "question-5": "",
            "answer-5": "",
            "question-6": "",
            "answer-6": "",
            "question-7": "",
            "answer-7": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_BjkBE4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Subscription Management",
            "question": "What comes in a monthly subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>Each monthly shipment includes six packs of diapers (plus three packs of wipes as an optional add-on) for around a month's use. </p><p>We optimize monthly quantities based on the average number of diaper changes babies need as they grow, which is why the diaper count per pack changes by size: </p><ul><li>Size NB+1: 3 packs of 32 NB diapers (96 total) + 3 packs of 34 Size 1 diapers (102 total) = 198 diapers total. </li><li>Size 1: 34/pack, 204 total. Size 2: 32/pack, 192 total. </li><li>Size 3: 28/pack, 168 total. Size 4: 24/pack, 144 total. </li><li>Size 5: 22/pack, 132 total. </li><li>Size 6: 20/pack, 120 total. Wipes add-on: 3 packs of 72 wipes each, 216 total.</li></ul>",
            "question-1": "I have a Newborn + 1 subscription - what happens on my second order?",
            "answer-1": "<p>Newborn + 1 subscriptions automatically convert to a Size 1 subscription starting with order 2, since babies typically outgrow Newborn diapers quickly and won't need more after the first shipment.</p>",
            "question-2": "How do I pause, skip, adjust, or cancel my subscription?",
            "answer-2": "<p>You can make changes to your subscription at any time, right from your account: pause your subscription if you need a break, skip an upcoming shipment without canceling, adjust how often it ships if you need diapers more or less frequently, update your address if you've moved, or cancel whenever you'd like. </p><p></p><p>Prefer someone to handle it for you? Email us at hello@freestyle.world, we're happy to help directly.</p>",
            "question-3": "My baby needs a different size, do I have to pay anything to switch?",
            "answer-3": "<p>If you're an active subscriber, and the order has already arrived we'll do a one-time size swap at no extra cost. </p><p>If your order hasn't started processing you can swap sizes at any time with no extra cost directly in the subscriber portal. </p><p>Just let us know at hello@freestyle.world and we'll get you sorted. </p>",
            "question-4": "Can I change my size before my next shipment goes out?",
            "answer-4": "<p>Of course! We send a reminder a few days before shipment for any changes, and you can always update your account or reach out to us at hello@freestyle.world before your order moves into processing. </p><p>Unfortunately, once an order has begun processing, we cannot make any changes.</p>",
            "question-5": "",
            "answer-5": "",
            "question-6": "",
            "answer-6": "",
            "question-7": "",
            "answer-7": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_hyY7pj": {
          "type": "faq",
