            "title": "Retail Purchases",
            "question": "Where can I buy Skin❤️Shield diapers?",
            "answer": "<p>Find Skin❤️Shield diapers at <a href=\"https://www.target.com/p/freestyle-hyper-absorbent-ultra-soft-baby-diapers/-/A-94937680?preselect=94800621#lnk=sametab\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Target.com,</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Freestyle-Diaper-Size-NB-56CT/13911911502?classType=VARIANT&from=/search\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Walmart.com</span></a>, and in Target and Walmart stores nationwide. Check our <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Store Locator</span></a> to find your nearest location.</p>",
            "question-1": "Where can I buy BambooTek™ diapers?",
            "answer-1": "<p>Find BambooTek™ at <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/stores/Freestyle/page/CD0B44D6-E0DB-4834-978C-125C782022C4?ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandLogo_sto\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.amazon.com/stores/Freestyle/page/CD0B44D6-E0DB-4834-978C-125C782022C4?ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandLogo_sto\">Amazon</a> and retailers like Whole Foods and Natural Grocers nationwide via our <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\" title=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\">Store Locator</a>.</p>",
            "question-2": "Where can I buy Ultra Clean 99% Water Wipes?",
            "answer-2": "<p>Find Ultra Clean 99% Water Wipes online at <a href=\"https://www.target.com/p/freestyle-soft-jumbo-wipes-for-sensitive-skin-unscented/-/A-94937681?preselect=94800620#lnk=sametab\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Target.com</span></a>, <a href=\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/FRSTYL-WIPES-216CT/14979954397\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Walmart.com</span></a>, and <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/stores/Freestyle/page/CD0B44D6-E0DB-4834-978C-125C782022C4?ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandLogo_sto\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Amazon</span></a>. Find in Target, Walmart, Whole Foods, and Natural Grocers nationwide. Check our <a href=\"https://freestyle.world/pages/stores\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Store Locator</span></a> to find your nearest location.</p>",
            "question-3": "I bought Freestyle at Target, Walmart, or another retailer, what if I need to return or exchange it?",
            "answer-3": "<p>For returns, refunds, or exchanges on a retailer purchase, please contact that retailer directly; they'll have your order details and can help. We're always happy to answer product questions no matter where you bought Freestyle, reach out to us directly at hello@freestyle.world.</p>",
            "question-4": "I used the Aisle app for a rebate, who do I contact?",
            "answer-4": "<p>Rebates through the Aisle app are handled directly by Aisle support, so they'll be the fastest way to get this sorted. You can reach them right through the app.</p>",
            "question-5": "Why do some of your products look different on the shelf?",
            "answer-5": "<p>Our diapers and wipes recently underwent a design refresh. As our various retailers work through inventory, some of our products may have different packaging. Rest easy, though, the products are the same safe diapers and wipes.</p>",
            "question-6": "",
            "answer-6": "",
            "question-7": "",
