          }
        },
        "faq_b8B8WL": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns and Exchanges",
            "question": "What’s your return and exchange policy?",
            "answer": "<p>Given the nature of our products,<strong> we do not accept returns. </strong></p><p>If you're an active subscriber and a size in your current order isn't quite working out, let us know, and we'll do a one-time swap at no extra cost. </p><p>If you purchased Freestyle products at another retailer, their return and refund policy applies.</p><p>We stand behind every pack of Freestyle diapers and wipes. If something is off, please always reach out to us at hello@freestyle.world. </p>",
            "question-1": "When will I receive my refund?",
            "answer-1": "<p>If we issue a refund, it may take a few days to show up on your credit card statement depending on your financial institution and their policies. If you need any additional support, please contact hello@freestyle.world and we will do our best to answer your questions. </p>",
